"true\">,</span> <span id=\"tgtAlignment_246\" class=\"ts-alignment-element\" data-is-focusable=\"true\">organizations</span> <span id=\"tgtAlignment_247\" class=\"ts-alignment-element\" data-is-focusable=\"true\">can</span> <span id=\"tgtAlignment_248\" class=\"ts-alignment-element\" data-is-focusable=\"true\">better</span> <span id=\"tgtAlignment_249\" class=\"ts-alignment-element\" data-is-focusable=\"true\">prepare</span> <span id=\"tgtAlignment_250\" class=\"ts-alignment-element\" data-is-focusable=\"true\">to</span> <span id=\"tgtAlignment_251\" class=\"ts-alignment-element\" data-is-focusable=\"true\">defend</span> <span id=\"tgtAlignment_252\" class=\"ts-alignment-element\" data-is-focusable=\"true\">themselves</span><span id=\"tgtAlignment_253\" class=\"ts-alignment-element\" data-is-focusable=\"true\">.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
            }
